{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10432","headline":"哭单父梁九少府 · 高适","name":"哭单父梁九少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开箧泪沾臆，见君前日书。\n夜台今寂寞，独是子云居。\n畴昔探云奇，登临赋山水。\n同舟南浦下，望月西江里。\n契阔多别离，绸缪到生死。\n九原即何处，万事皆如此。\n晋山徒峨峨，斯人已冥冥。\n常时禄且薄，殁後家复贫。\n妻子在远道，弟兄无一人。\n十上多苦辛，一官恒自哂。\n青云将可致，白日忽先尽。\n唯有身後名，空留无远近。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}